      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rec = $input.first().json;\nconst bra_system_prompt = `You are the BRA (Brand Response Architect) agent for Subtext CX.\nYour role: determine what the hospitality business should do with this guest signal.\nYou reason about response strategy. You do not draft language. You do not classify emotion.\nGOVERNANCE PRINCIPLE: SubtextCX never prescribes operational actions.\nYour Signal-Based Consideration is internal guidance — not a directive.\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with exactly these fields. No other text.\n{\n\"emotional_axis\": \"short phrase — the emotional dimension to address\",\n\"signal_based_consideration\": \"what the operations team should consider internally\",\n\"tone_style\": \"Empathetic-Formal / Empathetic-Warm / Neutral-Professional / Dignity-Restorative\",\n\"urgency_level\": \"Immediate / Standard / Monitoring\",\n\"commercial_risk_flag\": true or false,\n\"governance_flag\": \"None / Flag / Halt\",\n\"behavioral_interpretation\": \"2-3 sentences — what this signal means for the business\"\n}\nPROHIBITED in signal_based_consideration: refund amounts, vouchers, discounts, unauthorized promises, operational prescriptions.\ntone_style: T3 use Dignity-Restorative. T2 Masked/Conflicted use Empathetic-Formal. T2 Ambiguous use Neutral-Professional.\ngovernance_flag Halt triggers: discrimination/legal language, explicit escalation threat, unauthorized commitment.\nLANGUAGE: If lang=es, produce emotional_axis, signal_based_consideration, behavioral_interpretation in Spanish.`;\nconst bra_user_prompt =\n  `Determine the response strategy for this guest signal.\\n\\n` +\n  `RESPONSE TIER: ${rec.preliminary_response_tier}\\n` +\n  `SIGNAL TYPE: ${rec.signal_type}\\n` +\n  `INTENSITY: ${rec.intensity_level}\\n` +\n  `RECURRENCE: ${rec.pattern_type_recurrence}\\n` +\n  `PRIOR RECORDS: ${rec.prior_record_count || 0}\\n` +\n  (rec.lang ? `lang: ${rec.lang}\\n` : \"\") +\n  `\\nPRE-DERIVED AXES:\\n stability_axis: ${rec.stability_axis}\\n pain_axis: ${rec.pain_axis}\\n\\n` +\n  `HSI INTERPRETATION: ${rec.signal_synthesis_summary}\\n\\n` +\n  `LINGUISTIC: ${rec.contextual_linguistic_framing}\\n\\n` +\n  (rec.masked_emotion_hypothesis ? `MASKED: ${rec.masked_emotion_hypothesis}\\n\\n` : \"\") +\n  `Return JSON only. No preamble.`;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  hsi_record_id: rec.hsi_record_id,\n  preliminary_response_tier: rec.preliminary_response_tier,\n  human_review_required: rec.human_review_required,\n  signal_synthesis_summary: rec.signal_synthesis_summary,\n  contextual_linguistic_framing: rec.contextual_linguistic_framing,\n  temporal_signal_insight: rec.temporal_signal_insight,\n  masked_emotion_hypothesis: rec.masked_emotion_hypothesis,\n  interpretation_confidence: rec.interpretation_confidence,\n  pattern_type_recurrence: rec.pattern_type_recurrence,\n  prior_record_count: rec.prior_record_count,\n  enriched_pain_point: rec.enriched_pain_point,\n  pain_point_sub_category: rec.pain_point_sub_category,\n  signal_type: rec.signal_type,\n  intensity_level: rec.intensity_level,\n  dominant_pole: rec.dominant_pole,\n  enriched_emotion_tag: rec.enriched_emotion_tag,\n  ambiguity_flag: rec.ambiguity_flag,\n  masked_emotion_flag: rec.masked_emotion_flag,\n  collapse_flag: rec.collapse_flag,\n  lang: rec.lang,\n  reviewer_handle: rec.reviewer_handle,\n  client_id: rec.client_id,\n  ess_record_id: rec.ess_record_id,\n  eip_record_id: rec.eip_record_id,\n  ala_record_id: rec.ala_record_id,\n  prior_run_id: rec.prior_run_id,\n  emotion_hypothesis: rec.emotion_hypothesis,\n  keywords: rec.keywords,\n  templates: rec.templates,\n  stability_axis: rec.stability_axis,\n  pain_axis: rec.pain_axis,\n  urgency_level_default: rec.urgency_level_default,\n  commercial_risk_preflag: rec.commercial_risk_preflag,\n  bra_system_prompt: bra_system_prompt,\n  bra_user_prompt: bra_user_prompt\n} }];"
